                            "steamid": "76561198030027512",
                            "num_reviews": 26,
                            "playtime_forever": 130,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 102,
                            "last_played": 1632255336
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought this game after being very disappointed in Phasmophobia and how it has started to disappear up its own hat, increasing tediousness and difficulty in attempts to become a real life ghost hunting simulator.\n\nThe Spook Inspectors has the right amount of promise. It has humour from the start, the mechanics feels on point and the general premise is what you would hope for. Now all they need to do is build the story, the campaign, the progression mechanics, put in some variety, make the progression less monotonous and overall spice the game up - but that is what Early Access is all about :)\n\nEDIT: last update was in 2019, so this might be as far as the game goes. I should have checked before getting the game, really!",
